{"unit_id":"startGalway__dsh-secure-remote#card-zh","repo":"startGalway/dsh-secure-remote","commit":"7ca8d1d0ffc5717d22df71d0892811e0452819f4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-remote 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 SSH 工作区连接增强插件。它通过 bundle patch 替换内置 SSH provider，并保留现有 SSH 服务接口。插件支持连接状态显示与探测、连接失败后的重试、SSH 配置主机和密钥发现、密钥文件或文件夹选择，以及远程目录浏览和工作区创建；远程文件工具会检查路径是否仍在工作区根目录内。它适合需要通过 DSH 管理远程开发工作区的用户。使用需要 Node.js 22、本机 SSH 客户端和 POSIX 远端，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:411-492","client.js:220-322","secure-rpc.js:64-129"]}
{"unit_id":"startGalway__dsh-secure-remote#card-en","repo":"startGalway/dsh-secure-remote","commit":"7ca8d1d0ffc5717d22df71d0892811e0452819f4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-secure-remote adds SSH workspaces to DSH Web, replacing the built-in provider. It shows connection status, discovers hosts and keys, and supports directory browsing and workspace creation. File tools check paths against the workspace root. Requires Node.js 22, OpenSSH, and a POSIX host.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:411-492","client.js:220-322","secure-rpc.js:64-129"]}
