{"unit_id":"startGalway__dsh-secure-remote#feature-boundary","repo":"startGalway/dsh-secure-remote","commit":"7ca8d1d0ffc5717d22df71d0892811e0452819f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-remote 的功能「工作区路径边界」：远程文件工具执行前会检查路径是否位于 SSH 工作区根目录内，并对目标路径进行远端解析校验。遇到越界、无法验证或取消操作时会拒绝执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:389-408","path-guard.js:15-88"]}
